  "notes": [
    "Current Turso pin already includes bounded WAL frame scans (upstream PR9485); this experiment changes the separate WAL3 metadata backend.",
    "Only wal3.rs and wal3_shard.rs differ between frozen control and candidate production sources.",
    "This local transport probe does not establish remote S3 latency.",
    "Pre-checkpoint medians range from17.4% faster to9.6% slower; the largest positive difference is below0.45ms. No uniform pre-checkpoint speedup is claimed.",
    "The initial batch candidate showed larger pre-checkpoint overhead; the final implementation retains the original in-memory lookup path until an object shard exists.",
    "The first regression attempt lacked rustfs and failed38 service-dependent tests. Supplying the repository-pinned executable produced81 passing tests for both candidates. No test was disabled to obtain that result.",
    "The optimized tests ran in the frozen comparison worktree; the two final metadata source files were copied byte-for-byte into the implementation worktree and their hashes verified."
  ],
